

[00:00.30]The chiks like to go
[00:02.30]Cheep, cheep, cheep
[00:04.72]When they’re feeling hungry
[00:07.18]And when they’re feeling cold
[00:09.78]The hen goes out
[00:11.46]Looking for wheat and corn
[00:14.25]She gives them food to eat
[00:16.78]And also keeps them warm
[00:19.13]Under her two wings
[00:21.06]The chiks are very cozy
[00:23.22]Until the next morning
[00:26.32]The chiks will sleep with mommy
